  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "没画的介入点",
      "items": [
        "产品层：project_trust / resources_discover 在 session_start 之前；input / user_bash 拦截用户输入；before_provider_request / headers / after_provider_response 围绕每次请求；session_before_switch / fork / tree / compact 可否决会话结构操作。",
        "harness：before_request / before_payload / after_response / before_navigation。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "失败策略不一样",
      "items": [
        "产品 tool_call 与 harness before_drive 异常向上抛（fail-closed）；before_tool 异常转为 block；其余 hook 报告 handler_error 后继续。",
        "两列不是一一对应：扩展事件跑在旧 AgentSession 上，hooks 跑在新 durable 内核上。"
      ]
    }
  ]
